      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T22:54:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The question I originally asked was whether `FP_MODE_ANY_CAPTURE` is a subset of the bits cleared in `FP_MODE_CAPTURE_TYPE_MASK`. In that case, we only need to clear `FP_MODE_CAPTURE_TYPE_MASK`. Can you check the definition of `FP_MODE_ANY_CAPTURE`?",
