      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T23:02:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No it is not. [FP_MODE_ANY_CAPTURE](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/fpsensor/fpsensor_modes.h;l\u003d11?q\u003dplatform%2Fec%20FP_MODE_ANY_CAPTURE#:~:text\u003d10-,11,-12) is defined as:\n\n```\ninline constexpr uint32_t FP_MODE_ANY_CAPTURE \u003d\n\t(FP_MODE_CAPTURE | FP_MODE_ENROLL_IMAGE | FP_MODE_MATCH);\n```\n\nwhere \n\n[FP_MODE_CAPTURE](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d8347?q\u003dFP_MODE_CAPTURE\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d8346-,8347,-8348), [FP_MODE_ENROLL_IMAGE](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d8351?q\u003dFP_MODE_CAPTURE\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d8350-,8351,-8352), and [FP_MODE_MATCH](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d8353?q\u003dFP_MODE_CAPTURE\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d8352-,8353,-8354) are defined as bit 3, 5, and 6, respectively.",
